NimbyAdminServer (Central Scrutinizer, server half) - original work by Jeff Fabish for
NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp. Written from scratch against vanilla DayZ 1.30; no code
from Community Framework, Community Online Tools, or VPP Admin Tools. Server-only: loaded
with -servermod=, never part of the Workshop item. Will modify the vanilla MissionBase and
MissionServer classes (Bohemia Interactive) for the self-test hook, connection-time ban
checks, and the RPC router. No media.

